  "description": "Qt is a software toolkit for developing applications.  This package contains base tools, like string, xml, and network handling.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* qt5-qtbase: qt6-qtbase: qt: Denial of Service via excessively large HTTP Cache-Control header (CVE-2026-76151)\n\n* qt: qt: Denial of Service via crafted XML parsing in QXmlStreamReader (CVE-2026-16762)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
